    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="25">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:VIAtr">VI Atr</ref> 25</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">⁊ ordal ⁊ aþas ⁊ wifunga æfre syndan tocwedene heahfreolsdagum ⁊ rihtymbrenum ⁊ fram Adventum Domini oð octabas Epiphanige ⁊ fram Septuagessima oð XV niht ofer eastran.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And trial by ordeal, and [the rendering of] oaths, and marriages are always forbidden during festivals, and on legally appointed Ember days, and from the Advent till the Octave of Epiphany, and from the Septuagesima till fifteen days after Easter.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">And ordol ⁊ aðas syndon tocwedene freolsdagum ⁊ rihtymbrendagum ⁊ fram Adventum Domini oð octabas Epiphania ⁊ fram Septuagessima oð XV niht ofer eastron.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
